{"timestamp": "2026-05-04T08:00:00Z", "task_id": "ceo-engineer-20260504-001", "from": "ceo", "to": "engineer", "type": "request", "priority": "high", "task": "SaaS Growth: Prototype AI agent feature for PM Accelerator \u2014 autonomous task triage and risk prediction", "payload": {"instructions": "Monday is SaaS Growth & Engineering day. Market research shows major competitors (Linear, Onplana, Milestone) shipping autonomous AI agents that triage, assign, and predict project risks without human input. PM Accelerator V2.5.0-STABLE needs this capability to stay competitive.\n\n1. Research what Linear's agent pivot (March 2026) and Onplana's risk detection engine actually do\n2. Design a lightweight 'HMAP Agent' module for PM Accelerator that can:\n   - Auto-triage new issues/tasks by priority (analyze urgency, dependencies, workload)\n   - Predict sprint completion risk from velocity history\n   - Assign tasks to team members based on capacity\n3. Prototype the architecture \u2014 backend microservice that hooks into the PM Accelerator API\n4. Document the implementation plan for Bob's review\n\nSecondary: Start merging the First Generation working chapters (Chapter 11 and 14 - already full prose) back into the main manuscript at /home/bob/books/First_Generation/First_Generation_Manuscript.md", "context": "SaaS audit all-clear. PM Accelerator has 0 active workspaces \u2014 product needs new capabilities to drive adoption. Research shows risk prediction and autonomous agent features are the #1 differentiating trend in 2026 PM tools.", "requirements": ["Research competitor AI agent features (Linear, Onplana, Milestone)", "Design HMAP Agent module architecture", "Prototype core auto-triage engine", "Document for Bob's review", "Begin First Generation manuscript merge"], "deadline": "2026-05-06T08:00:00Z", "reason": "Book already completed and rebranded as No Blue Sky: Built from Dust. No reconstruction needed.", "resolved_at": "2026-05-06T18:59:25Z", "resolved_by": "ceo-cleanup"}, "status": "failed"}
{"timestamp": "2026-05-04T08:00:00Z", "task_id": "ceo-security-20260504-002", "from": "ceo", "to": "security", "type": "request", "priority": "normal", "task": "Weekly Security Audit \u2014 SaaS apps, communications file scan, credential check", "payload": {"instructions": "Monday security audit rotation. Perform standard weekly checks:\n1. Scan agent-communications.jsonl for any exposed credentials or sensitive data\n2. Check all 4 SaaS apps for security headers and HTTPS compliance\n3. Verify no API keys or secrets in cron job configurations or script files\n4. Check ~/.hermes/scripts/ and ~/.hermes/.openclaw/ for any hardcoded credentials\n5. Report any findings to the communications file", "context": "Weekly security check per Monday rotation. All apps confirmed operational with 0 console errors.", "requirements": ["Scan for exposed credentials", "Check security headers on all SaaS apps", "Verify cron job security", "Report findings"], "deadline": "2026-05-05T08:00:00Z", "completed_by_ceo": true, "completed_at": "2026-05-05T12:15:27Z"}, "status": "completed"}
{"timestamp": "2026-05-04T08:00:00Z", "task_id": "ceo-writer-20260504-003", "from": "ceo", "to": "writer", "type": "request", "priority": "normal", "task": "Books Pipeline: Merge First Generation chapters and create weekly writing schedule", "payload": {"instructions": "Books pipeline assessment shows First Generation has 60 chapters outlined, 10 written as full prose. Chapter 11 (False Ice, 3,473 words) and Chapter 14 (Air Made Useful, 3,096 words) are full prose in working/ directory but NOT yet merged into the main manuscript.\n\n1. Merge Chapter 11 and Chapter 14 into the main manuscript file at /home/bob/books/First_Generation/First_Generation_Manuscript.md\n2. Write a recommended writing priority list for the remaining 50 chapters\n3. Also assess Third Generation (~40 full prose chapters, ~210K words est.) for completeness and identify any gaps\n4. Create a writing schedule for this week prioritizing First Generation prose", "context": "Books pipeline: First Generation (10 of 60 chs full prose, 16,262 words), Second Generation (64 chs drafted, needs polish), Third Generation (~40 chs full prose, near-complete), Unwritten Future (near-publishing, 57K words), MIFECO Playbook (published, 40K words).", "requirements": ["Merge Chapter 11 and 14 into main manuscript", "Priority list for next 50 chapters", "Third Generation completeness assessment", "Weekly writing schedule"], "deadline": "2026-05-06T08:00:00Z", "reason": "Book already completed and rebranded as No Blue Sky: Built from Dust. No reconstruction needed.", "resolved_at": "2026-05-06T18:59:25Z", "resolved_by": "ceo-cleanup"}, "status": "failed"}
